{"sha": "746b67d9fafd15ed629599cb1dea004f8c02ee5041f28df13b5582efaead74c2", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\pic at (0,0) {beaker={0.7}{omDef!14}};", "  \\pic at (3.6,0) {beaker={0.7}{omDef!32}};", "  \\pic at (-0.3,0.25) {electrode={black!35}};", "  \\pic at (3.9,0.25) {electrode={orange!70!brown}};", "  \\pic at (0.35,0.55) {saltbridge={2.9}};", "  \\pic (m) at (1.8,4.3) {meter={V}};", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.15,2.65) |- (m-a);", "  \\draw[thick] (4.05,2.65) |- (m-b);", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.95,1.0) {\\ce{Zn}};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (4.45,1.0) {\\ce{Cu}};", "  \\node at (0.25,-0.35) {\\ce{Zn^2+}, \\ce{SO4^2-}};", "  \\node at (3.6,-0.35) {\\ce{Cu^2+}, \\ce{SO4^2-}};", "  \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (-0.15,3.35) -- (0.8,3.35) node[above, midway] {$\\mathrm{e^-}$};", "  \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (2.8,3.35) -- (3.75,3.35) node[above, midway] {$\\mathrm{e^-}$};", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.9,2.3) {$-$ 阳极};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (4.6,2.3) {阴极 $+$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (1.8,2.75) {盐桥\\\\ \\ce{K+} $\\rightarrow$ \\quad $\\leftarrow$ \\ce{NO3-}};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (-0.1,-0.8) {\\ce{Zn -> Zn^2+ + 2e-}};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (3.7,-0.8) {\\ce{Cu^2+ + 2e- -> Cu}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 锌–铜（丹尼尔）电池。锌在阳极被氧化，阳极为负极；", "铜离子在阴极被还原，阴极为正极。", "电子经外电路由锌流向铜；", "在盐桥中，阳离子向阴极迁移，阴离子向阳极迁移，", "从而使两个溶液均保持电中性。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "将电池写成一条线，阳极写在左侧：\\ce{Zn} $|$ \\ce{Zn^2+}", "$\\|$ \\ce{Cu^2+} $|$ \\ce{Cu}，单竖线表示相界面，双竖线表示盐桥。", "所有浓度均为 \\qty{1}{mol/L} 时，", "电池的电压为 \\qty{1.10}{V}。电池供出电流时发生的反应为", "\\ce{Zn + Cu^2+ -> Zn^2+ + Cu}，它正是在单一烧杯中会发生的反应；", "将两个半电池分开后，电子被迫经导线流动，", "从而能够做功。", "", "\\section{电极电势}", "", "电压是一个差值：只有两个半电池之间的电势差才能被测量。", "因此，参比半电池需要一次性选定。", "", "\\begin{definition}[电极电势，标准电极电势]\\label{def:b1:nernst:electrode-potential}", "\\emph{标准氢电极}\\index{标准氢电极}是一个铂电极，", "与压强为 \\qty{1}{bar} 的氢气接触，并", "浸入 \\ce{H+} 活度为 1 的理想溶液中。半电池的", "\\emph{电极电势}\\index{电极电势} $E$ 为半电池的电压，", "即以标准氢电极为左侧构成的电池的电压：", "$E = V_{\\text{半电池}} - V_{\\text{SHE}}$。当电对的每种物质活度均为 1 时，", "此电势即为该电对的\\emph{标准电极电势}\\index{标准电极电势}", "$E^\\circ$，在给定温度下为定值。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\pic at (0,0) {beaker={0.72}{omDef!14}};", "  % glass jacket, open at the bottom, with the gas inlet on the right", "  \\draw[om glass] (-0.32,0.35) -- (-0.32,3.0) -- (0.32,3.0) -- (0.32,2.55)", "    -- (0.95,2.55) (0.32,2.35) -- (0.95,2.35) (0.32,2.35) -- (0.32,0.35);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0.9) -- (0,3.45);", "  \\fill[black!60] (-0.16,0.5) rectangle (0.16,0.9);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y in {0.45/0.45, 0.55/0.75, 0.48/1.05, -0.45/0.5, -0.52/0.85}", "    \\draw[omDef!70] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.055);", "  \\draw[->] (1.9,2.45) node[right] {\\ce{H2}, \\qty{1}{bar}} -- (1.0,2.45);", "  \\draw (0.12,0.7) -- (1.5,0.2) node[right] {镀铂的铂};", "  \\draw (-0.6,1.1) -- (-1.4,1.6) node[left] {\\ce{H+}，活度为 1};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (0.05,3.45) {接至电路};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 标准氢电极：氢气鼓泡通过表面覆有细铂的铂片，", "铂片浸入 \\ce{H+} 活度为 1 的溶液中。", "其电对为 \\ce{H+}/\\ce{H2}，按", "约定其电势为 0。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "氢电极使用起来不太方便，实验室通常", "改用另一种更便利、电势已知的半电池进行测量。", "", "\\begin{definition}[参比电极]\\label{def:b1:nernst:reference-electrode}", "\\emph{参比电极}\\index{参比电极}是一种电势固定且已知的半电池，", "例如银–氯化银电极（银丝表面包覆氯化银，", "浸于浓度固定的氯化物溶液中）；", "或甘汞电极（汞", "与 \\ce{Hg2Cl2} 及氯化物溶液接触）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "下表给出本册所用的标准电极电势；", "下一节的竖直标尺给出了其中最常见的几种。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tabular}{lr@{\\qquad}lr}", "\\hline", "电对 & $E^\\circ$ (V) & 电对 & $E^\\circ$ (V) \\\\", "\\hline", "\\ce{Li+}/\\ce{Li} & $-3.04$ & \\ce{Cu^2+}/\\ce{Cu} & 0.34 \\\\", "\\ce{K+}/\\ce{K} & $-2.94$ & $[\\ce{Fe(CN)6}]^{3-}$/$[\\ce{Fe(CN)6}]^{4-}$ & 0.36 \\\\", "\\ce{Na+}/\\ce{Na} & $-2.71$ & \\ce{Cu+}/\\ce{Cu} & 0.52 \\\\", "\\ce{Mg^2+}/\\ce{Mg} & $-2.36$ & \\ce{I2}/\\ce{I-} & 0.53 \\\\", "\\ce{Al^3+}/\\ce{Al} & $-1.68$ & \\ce{O2}/\\ce{H2O2} & 0.69 \\\\", "\\ce{Zn^2+}/\\ce{Zn} & $-0.76$ & \\ce{Fe^3+}/\\ce{Fe^2+} & 0.77 \\\\", "\\ce{Fe^2+}/\\ce{Fe} & $-0.41$ & \\ce{Hg2^2+}/\\ce{Hg} & 0.80 \\\\", "\\ce{Ni^2+}/\\ce{Ni} & $-0.24$ & \\ce{Ag+}/\\ce{Ag} & 0.80 \\\\", "\\ce{Pb^2+}/\\ce{Pb} & $-0.13$ & \\ce{Br2}/\\ce{Br-} & 1.08 \\\\", "\\ce{H+}/\\ce{H2} & 0 & \\ce{O2}/\\ce{H2O} & 1.23 \\\\", "\\ce{S4O6^2-}/\\ce{S2O3^2-} & 0.02 & \\ce{MnO2}/\\ce{Mn^2+} & 1.23 \\\\", "\\ce{Cu^2+}/\\ce{Cu+} & 0.16 & \\ce{Cl2}/\\ce{Cl-} & 1.36 \\\\", "\\ce{AgCl}/\\ce{Ag} & 0.22 & \\ce{PbO2}/\\ce{Pb^2+} & 1.46 \\\\", "\\ce{Hg2Cl2}/\\ce{Hg} & 0.27 & \\ce{MnO4-}/\\ce{Mn^2+} & 1.51 \\\\", " & & \\ce{HClO}/\\ce{Cl2} & 1.63 \\\\", " & & \\ce{H2O2}/\\ce{H2O} & 1.76 \\\\", "\\hline", "\\end{tabular}", ""]}